00:29:03.600 --> 00:29:03.900
It was a Leaf.

00:29:03.900 --> 00:29:05.270
So, the Chinese have given to ours,

00:29:05.270 --> 00:29:06.710
themselves objectives in term of electric
cars,

00:29:09.030 --> 00:29:12.180
but they didn't bite the bullet yet
