00:29:20.050 --> 00:29:23.570
technology of electric cars in order to
hit it.

00:29:23.570 --> 00:29:25.970
Japan is, is, is putting a lot of
incentive.

00:29:25.970 --> 00:29:29.470
The charging system in Japan is really
developing.

00:29:29.470 --> 00:29:34.289
I have zeroed out on the fact, electric
car is a big part of the future.

00:29:34.289 --> 00:29:38.214
Where we don't control, and we are a
little bit frustrated

00:29:38.214 --> 00:29:43.648
in the speed at which the charging
infrastructure, is, is, is spreading.

00:29:43.648 --> 00:29:45.858
Now I can tell you I was, you know, I
think two

00:29:45.858 --> 00:29:48.599
years, two years ago, my daughter, who was
