00:34:03.886 --> 00:34:07.480
&gt;&gt; What matters most.

00:34:07.480 --> 00:34:09.227
Well, you know, I think what, what matters
most is,

00:34:09.227 --> 00:34:11.995
[BLANK_AUDIO]

00:34:11.995 --> 00:34:13.181
Making a difference.

00:34:13.181 --> 00:34:14.220
That's what matters most.

00:34:14.220 --> 00:34:14.975
I mean, making a difference.

00:34:14.975 --> 00:34:19.010
I mean, it can be professionally but it
can be socially, it

00:34:19.010 --> 00:34:23.549
can be the father, it can be as professor,
as a [UNKNOWN].

00:34:23.549 --> 00:34:24.830
You wanna make a difference.

00:34:24.830 --> 00:34:25.748
That's what matters most.

00:34:25.748 --> 00:34:29.280
You, you, you wanna say, well, you know,
I'm dedicating part of my life to do this.

00:34:30.450 --> 00:34:33.100
I wanna have the impression that I made a
difference.

00:34:33.100 --> 00:34:36.360
No matter how you measure this difference,
but the

00:34:37.940 --> 00:34:41.380
way you measure difference must be
important for you.

00:34:41.380 --> 00:34:41.840
Okay?

00:34:41.840 --> 00:34:43.930
I think that's what matters all the time,
as long as you

00:34:43.930 --> 00:34:47.180
think you can make a difference, while you
have the motivation to pursue

00:34:49.260 --> 00:34:49.890
whatever you're pursuing.

00:34:49.890 --> 00:34:53.229
And I'm not talking only on the field of
professional life.

00:34:53.229 --> 00:34:57.235
I'm talking also on the field of a
personal life or on

00:34:57.235 --> 00:35:02.180
contributing to [UNKNOWN] or contributing
to other, to other things in life.

00:35:02.180 --> 00:35:08.530
I think this is for me the most important
thing that you can see that what you're

00:35:08.530 --> 00:35:09.690
doing is something where you know that if

00:35:09.690 --> 00:35:12.210
you were not there things would have been
different.

00:35:12.210 --> 00:35:16.236
And hopefully by you being there, you
know, part of

00:35:16.236 --> 00:35:20.276
a team or part of a company, it's gonna
get better.

00:35:20.276 --> 00:35:22.303
But, obviously when you turn around the

00:35:22.303 --> 00:35:25.104
situation, you have a huge satisfaction,
because you

00:35:25.104 --> 00:35:29.171
say, you know, I was here, I was part of
the team who made this transformation.

00:35:29.171 --> 00:35:31.243
Okay, so it's obvious, but in some other
cases

00:35:31.243 --> 00:35:32.930
it would be a bit more difficult to see.

00:35:32.930 --> 00:35:34.440
&gt;&gt; Thank you so much.

