00:35:56.991 --> 00:35:59.200
&gt;&gt; Thank you very much for the interview.

00:35:59.200 --> 00:36:01.880
So I have a question about determining
models for the monozukuri.

00:36:01.880 --> 00:36:05.864
It means trading something in Japanese and
you said in your sun,

00:36:05.864 --> 00:36:09.987
monozukuri covers everything, every step
in value [UNKNOWN] from R and D

00:36:09.987 --> 00:36:14.316
to marketing, and my sense is in Japan,
sometimes the Japanese companies

00:36:14.316 --> 00:36:18.440
too much focus on monozukuri and they
focus R and D on technology.

00:36:18.440 --> 00:36:22.170
Trying to have some innovation from the
technology side

00:36:22.170 --> 00:36:25.150
and they failed to attract their customers
