00:36:25.150 --> 00:36:28.585
So my, my feeling is they should shift, on
the mindset,

00:36:28.585 --> 00:36:32.321
on mono, monozukuri and try to focus more
on the market side.

00:36:32.321 --> 00:36:38.479
So, what, what do you see this trend, and
how, how do you think the monozukuri.

00:36:38.479 --> 00:36:43.843
Hinders the Japanese companies to try to
articulate the demands in the East.

00:36:43.843 --> 00:36:46.684
&gt;&gt; yeah, I think it's a great observation

00:36:46.684 --> 00:36:49.858
to say Japanese company have a tendency to
try

00:36:49.858 --> 00:36:54.368
to create innovation out of technology too
much versus

00:36:54.368 --> 00:36:57.680
other company who gonna go and try to
assess.

00:36:57.680 --> 00:37:03.409
Or needs, or aspirations from from, from,
from, from consumers.

00:37:03.409 --> 00:37:05.828
That's why I believe that alliances
between

00:37:05.828 --> 00:37:08.730
companies of different cultures are so
powerful.

00:37:08.730 --> 00:37:12.210
Because each one brings with his own
culture, his own strength.

00:37:12.210 --> 00:37:17.034
And in our case if you can marry the
strengths of the monozukuri Japan.

00:37:17.034 --> 00:37:20.470
Through the creativity which comes with
French approach.

00:37:20.470 --> 00:37:24.419
As you know, we have a partnership with
Daimler

00:37:24.419 --> 00:37:28.972
with which we, we develop, also a lot of
technology.

00:37:28.972 --> 00:37:32.887
So, when you bring companies, as long as
the company remains autonomous,

00:37:32.887 --> 00:37:37.186
obviously, because if you merge all of
these automatically you're gonna blend.

00:37:38.510 --> 00:37:40.470
Everything into one culture, and you gonna

00:37:40.470 --> 00:37:43.190
lose, some, of the benefits, from
diversity.

00:37:43.190 --> 00:37:47.230
As long as you can make companies with
different culture working together.

00:37:47.230 --> 00:37:50.960
You gonna get the best out of every
single, single culture.

00:37:50.960 --> 00:37:53.120
But I agree with you.

00:37:53.120 --> 00:37:58.769
And, and that if, if you have, if you are
monocultural, the risk of you being.

00:37:58.769 --> 00:38:01.548
Too much benefiting from your own
strength, and

00:38:01.548 --> 00:38:04.474
ignoring your own weaknesses, they are
very big.

00:38:04.474 --> 00:38:07.827
That's why having Japanese company working
with the German

00:38:07.827 --> 00:38:11.374
company working with the French company is
such a delight,

00:38:11.374 --> 00:38:14.266
because we come to solutions that we could
have never

00:38:14.266 --> 00:38:17.577
imagined by our self, no matter where
we're coming from.

00:38:17.577 --> 00:38:19.019
So I totally agree with you.

00:38:20.190 --> 00:38:25.773
That's why I think Japanese companies
coupled with other companies as long as

00:38:25.773 --> 00:38:31.710
they know how to make these things happen
can be extremely, extremely efficient.

